                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Random Forest performed better overall than Logistic Regression.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Product characteristics contain useful predictive signal, but precision remains limited.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Price was the most informative feature, but feature importance does not imply causality.</run>
